msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:7 d06bc4e7a5724aeda4dd77f484d487f2
msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Loading the Firmware"
msgstr "传统直升机——固件烧录"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:9 23605dc76a214a5ab9e96604a61a1b21
msgid ""
"It is recommended to load the firmware in your autopilot and calibrate the "
"accelerometer before installing it in the frame. This is not absolutely "
"necessary, however, some helicopters are large and heavy. It is hard to "
"place it in all the orientations necessary for accel calibration, and is "
"much easier to do on the bench before installation. For desktop PC's the "
"following ground station software applications can be used to load firmware,"
" if ArduPilot firmware is already existing:"
msgstr ""
"建议在将飞控安装到机架之前先烧录固件并校准加速度计。这并非绝对必要，但某些直升机体积较大且较重，很难摆放到加速度计校准所需的所有方向，在安装前在工作台上完成校准会容易得多。对于桌面PC，如果已存在ArduPilot固件，可以使用以下地面站软件应用程序烧录固件："

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:16 0a7c2ffacbd64f52b56979b70ef5426f
msgid "1. `Mission Planner (Windows only) <https://ardupilot.org/planner/>`_"
msgstr "1. `Mission Planner（仅限Windows） <https://ardupilot.org/planner/>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:19 5a5d4b60a719402fa0cfbcf802271119
msgid ""
"2. `APM Planner2 (Windows, Mac or Linux) <https://ardupilot.org/planner2/>`_"
msgstr ""
"2. `APM Planner2（Windows、Mac或Linux） <https://ardupilot.org/planner2/>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:22 2812587434234068b4afd19bf26540b5
msgid ""
"3. `QGroundControl (Windows, Mac or Linux) <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`_"
msgstr "3. `QGroundControl（Windows、Mac或Linux） <http://qgroundcontrol.com/>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:25 270287df7ef347ed8478625642c6dda4
msgid ""
"For autopilots loaded with non-ArduPilot firmware, follow the instructions "
"on :ref:`this page <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`"
msgstr ""
"对于烧录了非ArduPilot固件的飞控，请按照 :ref:`此页面 <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-"
"only-boards>` 上的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:27 d053b4131ce14d09a9bee00980de3a7c
msgid ""
"Be sure to select the current stable version for Traditional Helicopters and"
" follow the instructions in your ground station."
msgstr "请务必为传统直升机选择当前稳定版本，并按照地面站中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:33 78df32b891ea43eab122e681a214dbe8
msgid ""
"Developers may also want to build the code and upload their own firmware. "
"See the :ref:`Developer wiki <dev:home>` for more information."
msgstr "开发者可能还希望编译代码并上传自己的固件。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`开发者wiki <dev:home>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/loading-the-code.rst:37 de8de619a71e4fa8a61e66e7b0142725
msgid ""
"Calibrating the accelerometer is identical to the procedure for other "
"vehicles. :ref:`See this topic <common-accelerometer-calibration>`."
msgstr "校准加速度计的步骤与其他飞行器相同。:ref:`请参阅此主题 <common-accelerometer-calibration>`。"
